        // The reference C passes: after newEmergencyOracle, the new oracle's owner is admin.
        // The buggy M sets owner to address(0), so admin cannot transferOwnership.
        // We check that admin can successfully call owner() on the last-created oracle.
        // Get the address of the last created EmergencyOracle via event
